==Miscellaneous==
*Added 5 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**3,050 grants 1 Epic Catfruit.
**3,150 grants 3 Special Catseyes.
**3,250 grants 3 Rare Catseyes.
**3,350 grants 3 Super Rare Catseyes.
**3,450 grants 3 Uber Rare Catseyes.
*Increased [[Gamatoto Expedition|Gamatoto]] level cap to 43.
*Collecting User Rank Rewards now fully refills [[Energy]].
*Ads can now be watched to recover Energy.

